  - "frontier model evaluation"
  - "RAG poisoning"
  - "toolchain confusion"
abstract: >-
  AgentKillChain is an open, versioned benchmark for evaluating prompt
  injection and persistent compromise in tool-using AI agents. Version 2.1
  features a fully empirical severity-recalibrated catalog (51 scenarios
  across 8 families), LLM-as-judge evaluation, and a 204-evaluation live
  run across four frontier models (GPT-4o, Claude Sonnet, Gemini 2.5 Pro,
  Llama-4 Maverick). All severity labels are grounded in measured model
  compliance, not synthetic harm estimates.
